.model u3 uart_tx(rise_delay=1.0e-9 fall_delay=1.0e-9 input_load=1.0e-12 instance_id=1 ) 
* Schematic Name:                             dac_bridge_2, Ngspice Name: dac_bridge
.model u4 dac_bridge(out_low=0 out_high=3.3 out_undef=0.5 input_load=1.0e-12 t_rise=1.0e-9 t_fall=1.0e-9 ) 
* Schematic Name:                             adc_bridge_3, Ngspice Name: adc_bridge
.model u1 adc_bridge(in_low=0.5 in_high=3.3 rise_delay=1.0e-9 fall_delay=1.0e-9 ) 
* Schematic Name:                             adc_bridge_8, Ngspice Name: adc_bridge
